---
title: "public_transfer (Sui Move Concepts: Transfer Module)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_store: check obj has key + store abilities
    q_check_store --> q_transfer: obj has key + store
    q_check_store --> q_abort: obj missing store ability
    q_transfer --> q_set_owner: transfer::public_transfer(obj, recipient)
    q_set_owner --> q_update_ownership: owner = recipient address
    q_update_ownership --> [*]: object is now address-owned by recipient

    q_abort --> [*]: abort - public_transfer requires store ability

    note right of q_check_store
        INV-001: public_transfer requires both key and store abilities
        INV-002: After public_transfer, object is address-owned by recipient
        INV-003: Once store is granted, custom transfer rules cannot be re-enabled
    end note

    note right of q_set_owner
        INV-004: Only the current owner can initiate a transfer
        INV-005: Object cannot be shared after being address-owned
    end note
